    "media:imagetext": "A San Francisco Airport Commission Exhibition\nSan Francisco International Airport\nBuilding For Air Travel\nArchitecture and Design for Commercial Aviation\nAIRPOR\nPetured at center: Skidmore, Owings \u0026 Merrill, Del Campo \u0026 Mara, Michael Walis \u0026 Associates, Joint Venture Architecte Model of tbe New International Terminal for San\nFrancisco International Airport, 1993.2000. Photographs clockwise froes upper left: Edero Saarinen, architect Trans World Airlines Terminal, John F. Kennedy International\nAirport, New York, 1956-62, 1970. Ezra Stoller, pbotograpber; Voe Gerkan, Marg \u0026 Partners, architecte Hambarg International Airport, 198694 Michael Wortmann\nphotographer, courtesy of Von Gerkan, Marg \u0026 Parters, Murphy/Jahn Architects. Helmut Jahn of Murply/lahs Architecte Terminal 1 at O Hare International Airport, 1988.\nHans Ege, photographer, courtesy of Murphy/Jahn Architects; Pier Luigi Nervi, architect. Hangar at the Air Force Base at Orvieto, Italy, 1945. Froen Moderne Bauformen (1939)\nOrganized by The Art Institute of Chicago\nMajor support for this exhibitice was provided be the National Endowment for the Hur\nex. Addidceal fusding was provided by Lafan German Airlines, Unted Airlines, and the\nRenefactors of Archicacture at The Art Institute of Chicand\nOn View Now\nIn the International Terminal\nNorth Connector Gallery\nLocated on the Upper\nLevel between Boarding\nArea D and Boarding\nArea F",
